---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Contact" ogTitle="Contact" ogDescription="Get in touch with questions or suggestions.">
  <h1>Contact</h1>

  <p>
    For anything at all — questions, suggestions, feedback, or adding a book to the
    library — please write to Michael Coughlin:
  </p>
  <p class="fs-5 mb-4">
    <a href="mailto:abereanone@pm.me">abereanone@pm.me</a>
  </p>

  <p class="text-body-secondary">
    Only if that fails — no reply after a while, or the mail bounces — try Courtney Hicks
    at <a href="mailto:books.freely@lyndnex.com">books.freely@lyndnex.com</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Add a Resource</h2>
  <p>
    Would you like to add a book to the library? You can submit a resource under a freely given,
    public domain license by visiting
    <a href="https://freely.giving/publish?type=books">freely.giving/publish</a> to see what you
    need to do, then email Michael at the address above.
  </p>
</Base>
